I'm asking if he thinks
we're in for a hard winter.

948
01:15:08,745 --> 01:15:10,703
He doesn't seem to know.

949
01:15:12,916 --> 01:15:15,204
I have a phobia of wolves!

950
01:15:30,725 --> 01:15:34,590
What a beautiful creature.
Wish him luck, boys.

951
01:15:35,019 --> 01:15:37,144
- Good luck, wolf.
- Good luck out there.

952
01:15:59,502 --> 01:16:02,456
These 3, in this reporter's opinion,
obsessed farmers

953
01:16:02,588 --> 01:16:07,083
remain convinced the fox in question
will eventually reappear. Why?

954
01:16:07,425 --> 01:16:09,666
- Foxes aren't meant to live in a sewer.
- They're refugees.

955
01:16:09,802 --> 01:16:12,758
- All they have to eat down there is...
- Trash!

956
01:16:13,139 --> 01:16:14,764
And not much of it.

957
01:16:15,184 --> 01:16:16,180
Uh-huh.

958
01:16:16,310 --> 01:16:20,556
Thank you, farmers.
For Action 12, this is Dan Peabody.

959
